// sbzk: compile / prove / verify the sound-bound co-presence statement
// with longfellow-zk (Ligero + sumcheck, Fp256Base, rate 7, 132 queries).
//
//   sbzk compile <circuit.bin>
//   sbzk prove   <circuit.bin> <witness.txt> <proof.bin> [--force]
//   sbzk verify  <circuit.bin> <public.txt>  <proof.bin>
//
// Exit codes: 0 ok, 1 prove refused / verify rejected, 2 usage/io error.
// --force: produce a proof even if the witness does not satisfy the circuit
// (uses the test-only forging prover generated by gen_forge.sh), to
// show that the VERIFIER rejects it, not only the honest prover.
